            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am not sure I understand the problem.\n\nWith 'mini.pairs' enabled with default config, typing `` ` `` leads to inserting a pair ``` `` ``` and cursor in between them. Typing `hello` will have cursor also move to the right and the second `` ` `` (right part of ``` `` ``` pair) is always on the right of the cursor during typing. Pressing `` ` `` again will lead to moving cursor past it and not insert a pair (as \"closeopen\" action is defined). The same happens with `'` and `\"`.\n\nCould you show a screencast and/or a *precise* sequence of keys and 'mini.pairs' config that lead to the case of `\"hello\"\"`?",
