            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ok, no problem.\n\nBy the way, https://github.com/windwp/nvim-autopairs will produce step 5 with the expected outcome (at least IMO). I just thought I'd add this context so you know why some folks might choose to switch to nvim-autopairs.\n\nI use `mini.ai` when I can but when naturally typing sometimes it's easier to manually add the quotes or character.",
